OL,3,GNEWSA'The town that never forgets'
OL,4,Amarks Armistice Day
OL,5,
OL,6,F"The town that never forgets" has
OL,7,Ffallen silent to hold its annual
OL,8,Fremembrance service event, marking
OL,9,FArmistice Day.
OL,11,FBedworth, in Warwickshire, has held its
OL,12,Fparade and service every year since
OL,13,F1921.
OL,15,FOn Wednesday, thousands flocked to
OL,16,Fwatch the parade, before gathering at
OL,17,Fthe town's war memorial for a service.
OL,18,FThe service was joined by young and
OL,19,Fold, as well as veterans, those
OL,20,Fcurrently serving and groups including
OL,21,Fpolice cadets, brownies and scouts.
OL,23,APub: 11-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
