OL,3,GNEWSA'The town that never forgets'
OL,4,Amarks Armistice Day
OL,5,
OL,6,F"It's a tradition that I don't think as
OL,7,Fa town we'll ever give up - no matter
OL,8,Fhow old people get, no matter the
OL,9,Fhundreds of years that pass," said
OL,10,FGeorge Finch, local councillor and
OL,11,Fleader of the borough council.
